const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"Lintner讨论风险资产估值与风险组合选择，为资本资产定价的均衡思路提供早期表述。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“The Valuation of Risk Assets and the Selection of Risky Investments in Stock Portfolios and Capital Budgets” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/1924119",label:{zh:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · 来源说明",en:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"理论设计从投资者偏好、风险资产与均衡价格出发，关注风险和预期回报之间的条件性关系。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “The Valuation of Risk Assets and the Selection of Risky Investments in Stock Portfolios and Capital Budgets”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/1924119",label:{zh:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · 来源说明",en:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"概念输入包括预期回报、风险、协方差与组合权重；这些不是无需估计误差即可直接观察的市场事实。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “The Valuation of Risk Assets and the Selection of Risky Investments in Stock Portfolios and Capital Budgets”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/1924119",label:{zh:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · 来源说明",en:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"模型解释的是在其假设下风险如何进入资产定价，而不是对单只股票未来回报的确定预测。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “The Valuation of Risk Assets and the Selection of Risky Investments in Stock Portfolios and Capital Budgets”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/1924119",label:{zh:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · 来源说明",en:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"明确无风险资产、投资者同质性、均值方差框架和市场组合的定义，再讨论任何经验检验。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “The Valuation of Risk Assets and the Selection of Risky Investments in Stock Portfolios and Capital Budgets”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/1924119",label:{zh:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · 来源说明",en:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965)。理论假设与现实市场摩擦、税费、约束和估计误差之间存在距离，不能省略。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) for “The Valuation of Risk Assets and the Selection of Risky Investments in Stock Portfolios and Capital Budgets”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/1924119",label:{zh:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · 来源说明",en:"The Review of Economics and Statistics (1965) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“The Valuation of Risk Assets and the Selection of Risky Investments in Stock Portfolios and Capital Budgets”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。理论假设与现实市场摩擦、税费、约束和估计误差之间存在距离，不能省略。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “The Valuation of Risk Assets and the Selection of Risky Investments in Stock Portfolios and Capital Budgets”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
